This repository contains a set of kidwords
and associated representations (phon, orth)
for connectionist modeling. Note that these
representations are possibly different.

For the patterns that can be used for modeling,
see orth.csv and phon.csv.

To see the scripts that generate those patterns
see code_to_orth.R and code_to_phon.R.

For the identity of the words themselves, see
kidwords.csv, orth-code-kid.csv, or
phon-code-kid.csv.
